<p>Define eligible recipients, optional shares, credential-page visits and programme-page visits separately. Record the period, campaign identifiers and consent rules; filter bots and duplicate views where the measurement system supports it. Enquiries or applications require their own attribution method. A view is not an enrolment, a hire or a causal brand lift.</p>

